  walkToMarkerTrigger: {fileID: 87001724}
  teleportTutorialTrigger: {fileID: 1558756482}
  jumpTutorialTrigger: {fileID: 2099522122}
  grabItemTrigger: {fileID: 1805814150}
  trashCanTrigger: {fileID: 1661640164}
  playerObject: {fileID: 333443769}
  resetPosition: {fileID: 556448341}
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to H.E.A.T. VR. To learn how to move and interact with the world, please
    proceed by pressing "B" button
  - Let's start with the basics. Your headset tracks your movement. Simply move your
    head to look around you. Look up, down, left, and right. Get a feel for your
    surroundings.
  - To walk, use the Left Thumbstick. Push it forward to move forward and back to
    move backward.
  - You'll see a glowing marker on the floor ahead. Please walk into the center of
    that marker to continue.
  - Excellent. Now let's proceed to the next control.
  - You can also teleport to move quickly. Push the Right Thumbstick forward to see
    an arc. Aim that arc at the glowing platform over there, then release the thumbstick
    to teleport. Try it now.
  - That's great. Now let's proceed to the next control.
  - To turn your view, flick the Right Thumbstick left or right. This will 'snap'
    your view in that direction. This helps prevent motion sickness. Try turning
    around now.
  - 'To jump, press the ''A'' Button on your right controller. '
  - Excellent. Press the 'Y' Button on your left controller to toggle your Tasklist.
    This will show you your current objectives.
  - That's great. Let's proceed with an object now.
  - Press the 'X' Button on your left controller to toggle your Investigation Mode.
    This will show details of an object.
  - Now, try picking up the cube in front of you using th grip buttons.
  - To let go of the item, simply release the Grip Button. Go ahead and drop the
    cube.
  - Excellent. Now try to dispose them by putting it in the trash can.
  - Excellent. You've mastered the controls. You are now ready to begin. Good luck.
